      "proof": "All 36 F20 behavior-source hashes were checked against the v23 predecessor. This map states the delta against v23 alone and is not cumulative: a source an earlier candidate restated reads unchanged here because it did not move again. Nine differ: historical qualification reading, the inert F46 audiobook tranche wiring that shares that source, the six further sources that wiring moves, the audio inspection protocol, and the report schema, whose source carries both the comment reconciled with that wiring and the discriminator move, which is why its class names both. The field-effect validation among them keeps the whole audiobook identity on the decision it validates and asks the value projection for the base option's shape, which is the only reason it moved. domain/audio_inspection.py carries audio_probe_facts: the child protocol advances to audio-inspection-v3 with the per-file demuxer-family, codec-name and sample-entry-tag facts and the presence of a stated duration, all read from headers alone, four container and stream observation kinds, the candidate citation an observation may carry, and the admitted codec and container constants, the container table exposed read-only so no importer can redefine what container_unexpected means for the rest of the process. domain/metadata_report.py carries report_schema_v40_and_comment: the report discriminator advances to metadata-report-v40, an audio observation parses its candidate citation, and a provider candidate records the runtime comparison qualification made before demotion; an observation's candidate citation must name an identity the report retains, so a comparison is refused at both the writer and the reader unless the edition it was made against is still there to be read. Fourteen of the 15 provider bindings are retained unchanged; the provider-contract binding for the metadata report application is rotated because qualification now records, on the candidate it shapes, that this recording is short of the running time that candidate stated -- a comparison ADR-0061's demotion would otherwise destroy, and states an edition only when every candidate naming it was found short, because qualification runs once per provider and a disagreement between two of them is not evidence of a shortfall. Three review-projection bindings are restated, each for its own reason. The metadata policy adapter reads the qualified option set live where it held a frozen constant, so activating a tranche moves no adapter source. The metadata report adapter abstains for a recording before the policy is read only while no tranche is qualified, and carries the case media kind into the projection. The review web application projects read-time media-health observations on the report detail and the review case, reads a recording's attention per field from the automatic outcome a record made rather than from its media kind alone, states provider and choice-source names from the one canonical label table, and now serves the widened media-health vocabulary under review-case-detail-v3 and review-library-v2 with the reader's terminal track grammar tightened to the writer's own. The frontend byte binding is rotated for the same media_health_projection reason, adding the observation view and the review-report-detail-v3 requirement, and holding the library document to review-library-v2 alone, again for the policy state's audiobook qualification summary, which is read-only and states no tranche as available while no record is published, and again for the widened MEDIA_HEALTH_KINDS and the moved wire tokens. The qualifier and human-decision byte bindings are retained. Options, scoring inputs and measurements are unchanged; no rescoring or fresh holdout is claimed."
